{"title": "Grotesque Distention (Condition)", "pageid": 32412, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Grotesque_Distention_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status groups", "Has status properties", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Bloated_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bloated_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Bloated_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Bloated_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Bloated_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Bloated_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bloated Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Bloated_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bloated_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/7/78/Bloated_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Grotesque Distention</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Bloated beyond hope. Will explode at the slightest touch.</li>\n<li>Touching an entity affected with this condition will cause a blast of <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-poison\">8d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poison\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-poison\">Poison</span></a> damage in a 3 m (10 ft) radius, form a <a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Cloud\" title=\"Poison Cloud\">Poison Cloud</a> of the same size, and utterly destroy the entity. </li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/40px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Incapacitated,&nbsp;Prone\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Incapacitated_(status_group)\" title=\"Incapacitated (status group)\">Incapacitated</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(status_group)\" title=\"Prone (status group)\">Prone</a></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/38px-Plus_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Status groups\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\">Status groups</a>: <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Incapacitated\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"SG Incapacitated\">SG_Incapacitated</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Prone\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"SG Prone\">SG_Prone</a>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/ApplyToDead\" title=\"Status properties/ApplyToDead\">ApplyToDead</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Affects the corpse of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ellswort\" title=\"Ellswort\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/Portrait_Ellswort.png/25px-Portrait_Ellswort.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/44/Portrait_Ellswort.png/38px-Portrait_Ellswort.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/44/Portrait_Ellswort.png/50px-Portrait_Ellswort.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ellswort\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/Portrait_Ellswort.png/25px-Portrait_Ellswort.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/44/Portrait_Ellswort.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ellswort\" title=\"Ellswort\">Ellswort</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Graveyard\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Graveyard\">Graveyard</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-12&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;16</span>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creatures_with_Grotesque_Distention\">Creatures with Grotesque Distention</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ellswort\" title=\"Ellswort\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/Portrait_Ellswort.png/30px-Portrait_Ellswort.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/44/Portrait_Ellswort.png/45px-Portrait_Ellswort.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/44/Portrait_Ellswort.png/60px-Portrait_Ellswort.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ellswort\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/Portrait_Ellswort.png/30px-Portrait_Ellswort.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/44/Portrait_Ellswort.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ellswort\" title=\"Ellswort\">Ellswort</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Touching this character will cause a blast of <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-poison\">8d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poison\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-poison\">Poison</span></a> in a small radius, destroying the corpse.</div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203117\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.060 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.064 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2351/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 24625/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9652/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.020/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1217825/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   55.092      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   55.092      1 -total\n 59.05%   32.532      3 Template:Hidden_code\n 25.08%   13.816      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 22.23%   12.246      7 Template:Icon_text\n 20.96%   11.548      6 Template:Icon_link\n 20.40%   11.236     31 Template:Trim\n 18.20%   10.025      1 Template:PageSeo\n 11.40%    6.280      1 Template:Condition_sources/format\n 10.47%    5.767      1 Template:MdCharLink\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:32412-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714203117 and revision id 374611. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</